   "source": [
    "# FFT-Based PEEC — Method 3+4 (Tooth-Tip Source + Region Weighting)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Goal:** Reproduce FEA's C1/C6 eddy current gradient using asymmetric PEEC source weighting.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Pipeline:**\n",
    "1. Phase A: Setup (Imports → TXT parsing → Mesh extraction)\n",
    "2. Phase B: PEEC Model (Grid → Z matrix → Slot filter → Boundary)\n",
    "3. Phase C: FEA Reference (FullFEA → Je extraction)\n",
    "4. Phase D: FFT-PEEC + Method 3+4 (Harmonic solve → Region weighting)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Motor:** 8P/48S IPM Hairpin, 6 layers/slot, f_e=1067Hz at 16000RPM  \n",
    "**Reference:** Morisco 2019 (PEEC-FFT), Dowell/Ahagon (proximity effect)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d42c7084",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Phase A: Environment Setup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "61800bc8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
